# Steinhaufen (the stones the pilgrims carried up, Steinetragen), front-layer
# prop: a heap of eight grey stones of mixed sizes, each lit from the top
# left (i lit cap, m body, d shade bottom right), stones behind separated
# by d, a k outline round the heap. Drawn by the pixel-artist with a
# throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = steinhaufen
size   = 32x16
origin = 16,16
anim   = idle frames=1
